WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.364
Review any app

00:00:01.223 --> 00:00:02.260
or doc without

00:00:02.072 --> 00:00:02.991
edit access

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:04.359
Remark is a

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.715
free open-source app

00:00:05.527 --> 00:00:06.764
for reviewing anything

00:00:06.576 --> 00:00:07.413
on your screen

00:00:07.578 --> 00:00:08.344
from a friend's

00:00:08.156 --> 00:00:09.276
app onboarding to

00:00:09.088 --> 00:00:10.502
design feedback or

00:00:10.314 --> 00:00:11.682
bug bounty evidence

00:00:12.214 --> 00:00:13.310
Press a shortcut

00:00:13.157 --> 00:00:14.088
and drag over

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:14.442
part of the

00:00:14.254 --> 00:00:15.681
screen or highlight

00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:16.081
text

00:00:16.188 --> 00:00:17.272
then type or

00:00:17.084 --> 00:00:17.933
speak a note

00:00:17.863 --> 00:00:18.640
and tag it

00:00:18.464 --> 00:00:19.301
as a bug

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.445
UX issue

00:00:20.492 --> 00:00:21.942
question or idea

00:00:22.478 --> 00:00:23.503
Every note lands

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:24.011
in a local

00:00:23.822 --> 00:00:24.494
session

00:00:24.553 --> 00:00:25.343
and you export

00:00:25.155 --> 00:00:26.180
one report as

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:26.829
PDF

00:00:27.018 --> 00:00:28.610
HTML Markdown

00:00:28.669 --> 00:00:30.402
JSON or CSV

00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:31.307
It runs on

00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:32.581
macOS 13 and

00:00:32.393 --> 00:00:33.807
later and Windows

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.364
Full story on

00:00:35.175 --> 00:00:36.071
the dashboard
